# Static redirects for the assets-only Worker. Cloudflare consumes this file
# rather than serving it, so it never appears at /_redirects.
#
# /desktops was a page until 2026-08-12; its catalogue is now the first
# section of the landing page. Both spellings are listed because the
# no-slash form only 307s to the slash form while an index.html exists at
# that path, and it no longer does.
#
# Exact paths only, never `/desktops/*` — the deep page /desktops/nebelhaus/
# did NOT move, and a wildcard here would swallow it.
/desktops     /#desktops   301
/desktops/    /#desktops   301
